      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-63438",
      ":question/problem": "![](images/01/018ea505e66cfa1751a29444d59a40ffab590a091fbcb6466de8b654c64c1be4.png)\n\nA group of graduate students was asked how long they watch TV every day. The histogram above shows the corresponding data. Which of the following statements are true?\n\n1. The distribution is symmetric.\n2. The distribution is right-skewed.\n3. The distribution is left-skewed.\n4. The median time lies between $40$ and $59$ minutes."
